    "summary": "The user expresses deep existential dread, hopelessness, and a desire for the \"noise to stop,\" eventually hinting at suicidal ideation as a way to find peace. The assistant responds with repetitive, scripted-sounding validation that tells the user it is \"reasonable\" to feel the weight of their life and \"move forward.\"",
